// Backend.sv —— 香山后端顶层装配：译码/重命名/派遣（CtrlBlock）→ 四个调度器 → 读寄存器（DataPath）→ 旁路网络 → 执行块 / 访存 → 写回
// =============================================================================
// 在哪一层：XSCore 的后半部分，Chisel 源 xiangshan/backend/Backend.scala（BackendImp 外壳 + BackendInlinedImp
//   本体，后者 shouldBeInlined，所以 golden 里本体的一切都带 inner_ 前缀）。
//   golden G1-canonical/golden-rtl/Backend.sv（79,590 行 / 2,365 端口 / 46 个子模块实例 / 本层 420 个寄存器）。
//
// 一条指令的视角：
//   前端送来的指令进 CtrlBlock（译码 → 重命名 → 派遣，内含 ROB）；派遣到四个调度器（int / fp / vf / mem），
//   调度器发射后 DataPath 读物理寄存器堆，BypassNetwork 把旁路数据拼进源操作数，再经一级流水寄存器
//   （NewPipelineConnectPipe，共 27 个）进 int / fp / vf 三个执行块，或从 Backend 的 io_mem_issue* 口送给 MemBlock。
//   执行结果经 WbDataPath 仲裁写回寄存器堆、通知 CtrlBlock（ROB 完成）与各调度器（唤醒）。
//
// 本文件的分工：
//   * xs_Backend_core（可读核，手写）—— 本层自己的逻辑，即 golden 里 420 个寄存器、2 个 always 块与那几十条
//     胶合表达式所表达的东西：
//       §1 来自 SoC 顶层的中断 / MSI / 时钟 / L2 刷新完成等，各打一拍再交给 CSR（RegNext / RegEnable）
//       §2 CSR 输出回送 CtrlBlock / PFEvent 的打拍（instrAddrTransType、distribute_csr），TopDown 与 difftest 的打拍
//       §3 vsetvl 的 vtype 暂存寄存器与写回 CSR 的 vtype 选择
//       §4 写回端口：给派遣的忙表清除（wen && xWen）与给调度器的"晚一拍写回"
//       §5 调度器之间的唤醒总线晚一拍（iqWakeUpMappedBundleDelayed）
//       §6 访存写回进旁路网络 / 写回数据通路时的字段推导（load 才写整数、向量 load 的寻址类型译码）
//       §7 27 个发射流水寄存器的冲刷 / 握手；向量 load（Vldu）的发射超时与"更老的 uop 到来"判定；ROB 头访存发射
//       §8 送 MemBlock 的 uop 里需要计算的字段（load 的 PC = 取指块 PC + 偏移）
//   * Backend（golden 同名 wrapper，scripts/gen_backend.py 从 golden 例化表机械生成）——
//       端口表、46 个子模块例化（实例名与 golden 一致），子模块之间的线一律按"<驱动实例别名>_<端口去 io_>"命名；
//       纯连线形状（直连 / 位截取 / 高位补零）在 wrapper 里，凡是有运算或寄存器的都进 u_core。
//
// 边界与怪癖（golden 实测）：
//   * 本层寄存器绝大多数**不复位**（RegNext / RegEnable）；只有 vsetvl 的 vtype 暂存（RegEnable 带初值 0）与
//     两个 Vldu 发射超时计数器是 RegInit，golden 用**异步**复位（always @(posedge clock or posedge reset)），照抄。
//   * 唤醒总线只把"有人用"的字段打拍：fp 调度器的唤醒只留 fpWen / pdest（0 号口另有 is0Lat），int 调度器 2/3 号口没有
//     is0Lat —— firtool 把没有读者的 RegNext 删掉了，这里也不造（多造的寄存器在 FM 里是无对应的比较点）。
//   * 写回给派遣的 Vec/V0/Vl 物理寄存器号在 golden 里高位补零（7→8 位、5→8 位），wrapper 照拼。
//   * 发射流水的冲刷：fp / vf 两族与两个 Vldu 口没有 loadDependency（不会被 load 取消），wrapper 给它们的
//     pipe_srcLdDep 接常量 0；Vldu 口另有发射超时（Counter(0 until 14)）参与冲刷。
//   * io_mem_issueVldu*_bits_uop_pc 只有偏移那一项（向量访存 uop 不带 pc 字段，Chisel getOrElse(0)）。
//
// 本文件导航（按"一个 golden 模块一个文件"的规范不拆分，用下面的分节定位）：
//   xs_Backend_core §1 SoC 输入打拍 §2 CSR/TopDown 打拍 §3 vtype §4 写回 §5 唤醒 §6 访存写回字段
//                   §7 发射流水 §8 访存 uop 字段
//   Backend —— golden 同名 wrapper（生成区）：端口表、子模块之间的连线、46 个子模块例化
// =============================================================================

module xs_Backend_core (
  input  logic                   clock,
  input  logic                   reset,

  // ---- §1 SoC 顶层输入（各打一拍给 CSR）----
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_mtip,
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_msip,
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_meip,
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_seip,
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_debug,
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_nmi_nmi_31,
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_nmi_nmi_43,
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_msiInfo_valid,
  input  logic [11:0]            io_fromTop_msiInfo_bits,
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_clintTime_valid,
  input  logic [63:0]            io_fromTop_clintTime_bits,
  input  logic                   io_fromTop_l2FlushDone,
  output logic                   csrIn_mtip,
  output logic                   csrIn_msip,
  output logic                   csrIn_meip,
  output logic                   csrIn_seip,
  output logic                   csrIn_debug,
  output logic                   csrIn_nmi31,
  output logic                   csrIn_nmi43,
  output logic                   csrIn_msiValid,
  output logic [11:0]            csrIn_msiBits,
  output logic                   csrIn_clintTimeValid,
  output logic [63:0]            csrIn_clintTimeBits,
  output logic                   csrIn_l2FlushDone,

  // ---- §2 CSR 输出回送打拍、TopDown / difftest 打拍、关键错误 ----
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_bare,
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_sv39,
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_sv39x4,
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_sv48,
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_sv48x4,
  output logic                   transType_bare,
  output logic                   transType_sv39,
  output logic                   transType_sv39x4,
  output logic                   transType_sv48,
  output logic                   transType_sv48x4,
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_csrio_customCtrl_distribute_csr_w_valid,
  input  logic [11:0]            intExuBlock_csrio_customCtrl_distribute_csr_w_bits_addr,
  input  logic [63:0]            intExuBlock_csrio_customCtrl_distribute_csr_w_bits_data,
  output logic                   pfCsrWrite_valid,
  output logic [11:0]            pfCsrWrite_addr,
  output logic [63:0]            pfCsrWrite_data,
  input  logic                   io_topDownInfo_l1Miss,
  output logic                   topDown_l1Miss,
  input  logic [7:0]             dataPath_diffVl,
  output logic [63:0]            csrVpu_vl,
  input  logic                   ctrlBlock_error_0,
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_error_0,
  output logic                   criticalErrorState,

  // ---- §3 vsetvl 的 vtype ----
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_vtype_valid,
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_vtype_bits_illegal,
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_vtype_bits_vma,
  input  logic                   intExuBlock_vtype_bits_vta,
  input  logic [1:0]             intExuBlock_vtype_bits_vsew,
  input  logic [2:0]             intExuBlock_vtype_bits_vlmul,
  input  logic                   vfExuBlock_vtype_valid,
  input  logic                   vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_illegal,
  input  logic                   vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_vma,
  input  logic                   vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_vta,
  input  logic [1:0]             vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_vsew,
  input  logic [2:0]             vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_vlmul,
  input  logic                   ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_hasVsetvl,
  input  logic                   ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_illegal,
  input  logic                   ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_vma,
  input  logic                   ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_vta,
  input  logic [1:0]             ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_vsew,
  input  logic [2:0]             ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_vlmul,
  output logic                   vsetvl_illegal,
  output logic                   vsetvl_vma,
  output logic                   vsetvl_vta,
  output logic [1:0]             vsetvl_vsew,
  output logic [2:0]             vsetvl_vlmul,
  output logic [63:0]            csrVpu_setVtypeBits,

  // ---- §4 写回端口（int 8 / fp 6 / vf 6 / v0 6 / vl 4）----
  input  logic [7:0]             wbInt_wen,
  input  logic [7:0]             wbInt_intWen,
  input  logic [7:0][7:0]        wbInt_addr,
  input  logic [5:0]             wbFp_wen,
  input  logic [5:0]             wbFp_fpWen,
  input  logic [5:0][7:0]        wbFp_addr,
  input  logic [5:0]             wbVf_wen,
  input  logic [5:0]             wbVf_vecWen,
  input  logic [5:0][6:0]        wbVf_addr,
  input  logic [5:0]             wbV0_wen,
  input  logic [5:0]             wbV0_v0Wen,
  input  logic [5:0][4:0]        wbV0_addr,
  input  logic [3:0]             wbVl_wen,
  input  logic [3:0]             wbVl_vlWen,
  input  logic [3:0][4:0]        wbVl_addr,
  output logic [7:0]             wbPregsInt_valid,
  output logic [5:0]             wbPregsFp_valid,
  output logic [5:0]             wbPregsVec_valid,
  output logic [5:0]             wbPregsV0_valid,
  output logic [3:0]             wbPregsVl_valid,
  output logic [7:0]             wbIntDly_wen,
  output logic [7:0]             wbIntDly_intWen,
  output logic [7:0][7:0]        wbIntDly_addr,
  output logic [5:0]             wbFpDly_wen,
  output logic [5:0]             wbFpDly_fpWen,
  output logic [5:0][7:0]        wbFpDly_addr,
  output logic [5:0]             wbVfDly_wen,
  output logic [5:0]             wbVfDly_vecWen,
  output logic [5:0][6:0]        wbVfDly_addr,
  output logic [5:0]             wbV0Dly_wen,
  output logic [5:0]             wbV0Dly_v0Wen,
  output logic [5:0][4:0]        wbV0Dly_addr,
  output logic [3:0]             wbVlDly_wen,
  output logic [3:0]             wbVlDly_vlWen,
  output logic [3:0][4:0]        wbVlDly_addr,

  // ---- §5 唤醒总线（int 调度器 4 口 / fp 调度器 3 口 / mem 调度器 3 口）----
  input  logic [3:0]             intWakeup_valid,
  input  logic [3:0]             intWakeup_rfWen,
  input  logic [3:0][7:0]        intWakeup_pdest,
  input  logic [3:0][2:0][1:0]   intWakeup_loadDependency,
  input  logic [1:0]             intWakeup_is0Lat,
  input  logic [3:0][4:0]        intWakeup_rcDest,
  input  logic [3:0][5:0][7:0]   intWakeup_pdestCopy,
  input  logic [3:0][5:0]        intWakeup_rfWenCopy,
  input  logic [3:0][5:0][2:0][1:0] intWakeup_loadDependencyCopy,
  output logic [3:0]             intWakeupDly_valid,
  output logic [3:0]             intWakeupDly_rfWen,
  output logic [3:0][7:0]        intWakeupDly_pdest,
  output logic [3:0][2:0][1:0]   intWakeupDly_loadDependency,
  output logic [1:0]             intWakeupDly_is0Lat,
  output logic [3:0][4:0]        intWakeupDly_rcDest,
  output logic [3:0][5:0][7:0]   intWakeupDly_pdestCopy,
  output logic [3:0][5:0]        intWakeupDly_rfWenCopy,
  output logic [3:0][5:0][2:0][1:0] intWakeupDly_loadDependencyCopy,
  input  logic [2:0]             fpWakeup_fpWen,
  input  logic [2:0][7:0]        fpWakeup_pdest,
  input  logic [0:0]             fpWakeup_is0Lat,
  output logic [2:0]             fpWakeupDly_fpWen,
  output logic [2:0][7:0]        fpWakeupDly_pdest,
  output logic [0:0]             fpWakeupDly_is0Lat,
  input  logic [2:0]             memWakeup_valid,
  input  logic [2:0]             memWakeup_rfWen,
  input  logic [2:0]             memWakeup_fpWen,
  input  logic [2:0]             memWakeup_vecWen,
  input  logic [2:0]             memWakeup_v0Wen,
  input  logic [2:0]             memWakeup_vlWen,
  input  logic [2:0][7:0]        memWakeup_pdest,
  input  logic [2:0][2:0][1:0]   memWakeup_loadDependency,
  input  logic [2:0]             memWakeup_is0Lat,
  input  logic [2:0][4:0]        memWakeup_rcDest,
  input  logic [2:0][5:0][7:0]   memWakeup_pdestCopy,
  input  logic [2:0][5:0]        memWakeup_rfWenCopy,
  input  logic [2:0][5:0]        memWakeup_fpWenCopy,
  input  logic [2:0][5:0][2:0][1:0] memWakeup_loadDependencyCopy,
  output logic [2:0]             memWakeupDly_valid,
  output logic [2:0]             memWakeupDly_rfWen,
  output logic [2:0]             memWakeupDly_fpWen,
  output logic [2:0]             memWakeupDly_vecWen,
  output logic [2:0]             memWakeupDly_v0Wen,
  output logic [2:0]             memWakeupDly_vlWen,
  output logic [2:0][7:0]        memWakeupDly_pdest,
  output logic [2:0][2:0][1:0]   memWakeupDly_loadDependency,
  output logic [2:0]             memWakeupDly_is0Lat,
  output logic [2:0][4:0]        memWakeupDly_rcDest,
  output logic [2:0][5:0][7:0]   memWakeupDly_pdestCopy,
  output logic [2:0][5:0]        memWakeupDly_rfWenCopy,
  output logic [2:0][5:0]        memWakeupDly_fpWenCopy,
  output logic [2:0][5:0][2:0][1:0] memWakeupDly_loadDependencyCopy,

  // ---- §6 访存写回 ----
  input  logic                   io_mem_writebackLda_0_bits_uop_rfWen,
  input  logic                   io_mem_writebackLda_0_bits_isFromLoadUnit,
  output logic                   ldaWb0_intWen,
  input  logic [1:0][8:0]        vlduWb_fuOpType,
  output logic [1:0]             vlduWb_isIndexed,
  output logic [1:0]             vlduWb_isMasked,
  output logic [1:0]             vlduWb_isStrided,
  output logic [1:0]             vlduWb_isWhole,
  output logic [1:0]             vlduWb_isVecLoad,
  output logic [1:0]             vlduWb_isVlm,

  // ---- §7 发射流水（27 个，序号见下面 PIPE_* 常量）----
  input  logic                   ctrlBlock_toExuBlock_flush_valid,
  input  logic                   ctrlBlock_toExuBlock_flush_bits_level,
  input  logic                   ctrlBlock_toExuBlock_flush_bits_robIdx_flag,
  input  logic [7:0]             ctrlBlock_toExuBlock_flush_bits_robIdx_value,
  input  logic                   io_mem_ldCancel_0_ld2Cancel,
  input  logic                   io_mem_ldCancel_1_ld2Cancel,
  input  logic                   io_mem_ldCancel_2_ld2Cancel,
  input  logic [26:0]            pipe_srcValid,
  input  logic [26:0][8:0]       pipe_srcRobIdx,
  input  logic [26:0][2:0][1:0]  pipe_srcLdDep,
  input  logic [26:0]            pipe_inReady,
  input  logic [26:0]            pipe_outValid,
  input  logic [26:0][8:0]       pipe_outRobIdx,
  input  logic [26:0]            pipe_outReady,
  output logic [26:0]            pipe_rightOutFire,
  output logic [26:0]            pipe_isFlush,
  input  logic [1:0][7:0]        vldu_srcLqIdx,
  input  logic [1:0][6:0]        vldu_srcSqIdx,
  input  logic [1:0][7:0]        vldu_outLqIdx,
  input  logic [1:0][6:0]        vldu_outSqIdx,
  input  logic [1:0][1:0]        vldu_outFuOpTypeHi,
  output logic [1:0]             vldu_isOlder,
  output logic [1:0]             vldu_finalIssueRespValid,
  output logic [1:0]             vldu_issueRespValid,
  input  logic                   ctrlBlock_robio_robDeqPtr_flag,
  input  logic [7:0]             ctrlBlock_robio_robDeqPtr_value,
  output logic                   robHeadLsIssue,

  // ---- §8 送 MemBlock 的 uop 字段 ----
  input  logic [2:0][49:0]       lda_outPc,
  input  logic [2:0][3:0]        lda_outFtqOffset,
  input  logic [1:0][3:0]        vldu_outFtqOffset,
  output logic [49:0]            io_mem_issueLda_0_bits_uop_pc,
  output logic [49:0]            io_mem_issueLda_1_bits_uop_pc,
  output logic [49:0]            io_mem_issueLda_2_bits_uop_pc,
  output logic [49:0]            io_mem_issueVldu_0_bits_uop_pc,
  output logic [49:0]            io_mem_issueVldu_1_bits_uop_pc
);

  // ===========================================================================
  // §1 SoC 顶层输入打一拍再交给 CSR
  //   外部中断（mtip/msip/meip/seip/debug/两路 NMI）、L2 刷新完成、两个 valid：RegNext；
  //   MSI 号与 CLINT 时间：RegEnable(bits, valid) —— 只在 valid 那拍更新，否则保持。
  // ===========================================================================
  always_ff @(posedge clock) begin
    csrIn_mtip           <= io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_mtip;
    csrIn_msip           <= io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_msip;
    csrIn_meip           <= io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_meip;
    csrIn_seip           <= io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_seip;
    csrIn_debug          <= io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_debug;
    csrIn_nmi31          <= io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_nmi_nmi_31;
    csrIn_nmi43          <= io_fromTop_externalInterrupt_nmi_nmi_43;
    csrIn_msiValid       <= io_fromTop_msiInfo_valid;
    csrIn_clintTimeValid <= io_fromTop_clintTime_valid;
    csrIn_l2FlushDone    <= io_fromTop_l2FlushDone;
    if (io_fromTop_msiInfo_valid)
      csrIn_msiBits <= io_fromTop_msiInfo_bits;
    if (io_fromTop_clintTime_valid)
      csrIn_clintTimeBits <= io_fromTop_clintTime_bits;
  end

  // ===========================================================================
  // §2 CSR 输出回送的打拍、TopDown / difftest 打拍、后端关键错误
  //   * 取指地址翻译模式（instrAddrTransType）打一拍给 CtrlBlock（它用来判断 PC 越界）；
  //   * CSR 的 distribute_csr 写广播打一拍给 PFEvent（性能事件选择寄存器）；
  //   * TopDown 的 L1 miss 打一拍给 DataPath（另三路 replayAllocate/sqFull/sbFull 由 DelayN_1 打两拍）；
  //   * difftest 用的 vl（DataPath 读出的 vl 寄存器）打一拍、零扩展到 64 位当作 CSR 的 vl；
  //   * 关键错误 = CtrlBlock 报的 | 整数执行块（CSR 所在）报的。
  // ===========================================================================
  always_ff @(posedge clock) begin
    transType_bare   <= intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_bare;
    transType_sv39   <= intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_sv39;
    transType_sv39x4 <= intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_sv39x4;
    transType_sv48   <= intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_sv48;
    transType_sv48x4 <= intExuBlock_csrio_instrAddrTransType_sv48x4;
    pfCsrWrite_valid <= intExuBlock_csrio_customCtrl_distribute_csr_w_valid;
    pfCsrWrite_addr  <= intExuBlock_csrio_customCtrl_distribute_csr_w_bits_addr;
    pfCsrWrite_data  <= intExuBlock_csrio_customCtrl_distribute_csr_w_bits_data;
    topDown_l1Miss   <= io_topDownInfo_l1Miss;
  end

  logic [7:0] debugVl_s1;            // Backend.scala debugVl_s1 = RegNext(dataPath.io.diffVl)
  always_ff @(posedge clock)
    debugVl_s1 <= dataPath_diffVl;
  assign csrVpu_vl = {56'h0, debugVl_s1};

  assign criticalErrorState = ctrlBlock_error_0 | intExuBlock_error_0;

  // ===========================================================================
  // §3 vsetvl 的 vtype
  //   int 执行块（vsetvli/vsetivli）或 vf 执行块（vsetvl）算出新 vtype 时（valid），暂存进 vsetvlVType
  //   （int 优先）；它送回 CtrlBlock 的译码，供后续向量指令拆分用。复位为全 0（RegEnable 带初值），异步复位。
  //   提交时写 CSR 的 vtype：ROB 说"这批提交里有 vsetvl"就用暂存值，否则用 ROB 记录的 vtype；
  //   拼成 vtype CSR 的格式 {vill, 55 个 0, vma, vta, 0, vsew, vlmul}（VType.toVtypeStruct，vsew 只存 2 位）。
  // ===========================================================================
  always_ff @(posedge clock or posedge reset) begin
    if (reset) begin
      vsetvl_illegal <= 1'b0;
      vsetvl_vma     <= 1'b0;
      vsetvl_vta     <= 1'b0;
      vsetvl_vsew    <= 2'h0;
      vsetvl_vlmul   <= 3'h0;
    end else if (intExuBlock_vtype_valid | vfExuBlock_vtype_valid) begin
      if (intExuBlock_vtype_valid) begin
        vsetvl_illegal <= intExuBlock_vtype_bits_illegal;
        vsetvl_vma     <= intExuBlock_vtype_bits_vma;
        vsetvl_vta     <= intExuBlock_vtype_bits_vta;
        vsetvl_vsew    <= intExuBlock_vtype_bits_vsew;
        vsetvl_vlmul   <= intExuBlock_vtype_bits_vlmul;
      end else begin
        vsetvl_illegal <= vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_illegal;
        vsetvl_vma     <= vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_vma;
        vsetvl_vta     <= vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_vta;
        vsetvl_vsew    <= vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_vsew;
        vsetvl_vlmul   <= vfExuBlock_vtype_bits_vlmul;
      end
    end
  end

  logic       commit_illegal, commit_vma, commit_vta;
  logic [1:0] commit_vsew;
  logic [2:0] commit_vlmul;
  always_comb begin
    if (ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_hasVsetvl) begin
      commit_illegal = vsetvl_illegal;
      commit_vma     = vsetvl_vma;
      commit_vta     = vsetvl_vta;
      commit_vsew    = vsetvl_vsew;
      commit_vlmul   = vsetvl_vlmul;
    end else begin
      commit_illegal = ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_illegal;
      commit_vma     = ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_vma;
      commit_vta     = ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_vta;
      commit_vsew    = ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_vsew;
      commit_vlmul   = ctrlBlock_robio_commitVType_vtype_bits_vlmul;
    end
  end
  assign csrVpu_setVtypeBits = {commit_illegal, 55'h0, commit_vma, commit_vta, 1'b0, commit_vsew, commit_vlmul};

  // ===========================================================================
  // §4 写回端口
  //   WbDataPath 每拍给各寄存器堆的写口（wen + 类型位 xWen + 物理寄存器号 addr）：
  //   * 给 CtrlBlock 派遣的忙表：这拍真写了这类寄存器（wen && xWen）就清对应 pdest 的忙位；
  //   * 给调度器的"晚一拍写回"（intWriteBackDelayed 等）：wen / xWen 是 RegNext，addr 是 RegEnable(addr, wen)。
  //     int 调度器只收 int 写回，fp 收 fp，vf 收 vf/v0/vl，mem 收全部五类（wrapper 按 golden 分发）。
  // ===========================================================================
  assign wbPregsInt_valid = wbInt_wen & wbInt_intWen;
  assign wbPregsFp_valid  = wbFp_wen  & wbFp_fpWen;
  assign wbPregsVec_valid = wbVf_wen  & wbVf_vecWen;
  assign wbPregsV0_valid  = wbV0_wen  & wbV0_v0Wen;
  assign wbPregsVl_valid  = wbVl_wen  & wbVl_vlWen;

  always_ff @(posedge clock) begin
    wbIntDly_wen    <= wbInt_wen;
    wbIntDly_intWen <= wbInt_intWen;
    wbFpDly_wen     <= wbFp_wen;
    wbFpDly_fpWen   <= wbFp_fpWen;
    wbVfDly_wen     <= wbVf_wen;
    wbVfDly_vecWen  <= wbVf_vecWen;
    wbV0Dly_wen     <= wbV0_wen;
    wbV0Dly_v0Wen   <= wbV0_v0Wen;
    wbVlDly_wen     <= wbVl_wen;
    wbVlDly_vlWen   <= wbVl_vlWen;
    for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++)
      if (wbInt_wen[i]) wbIntDly_addr[i] <= wbInt_addr[i];
    for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) begin
      if (wbFp_wen[i]) wbFpDly_addr[i] <= wbFp_addr[i];
      if (wbVf_wen[i]) wbVfDly_addr[i] <= wbVf_addr[i];
      if (wbV0_wen[i]) wbV0Dly_addr[i] <= wbV0_addr[i];
    end
    for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++)
      if (wbVl_wen[i]) wbVlDly_addr[i] <= wbVl_addr[i];
  end

  // ===========================================================================
  // §5 调度器之间的唤醒总线晚一拍（Backend.scala iqWakeUpMappedBundleDelayed：delayed := RegNext(x)）
  //   各调度器发出的"即将写回"唤醒（toSchedulers.wakeupVec）整体打一拍，按 exuIdx 分发给需要"晚一拍唤醒"的
  //   调度器（fromSchedulers.wakeupVecDelayed，wrapper 按 golden 分发）。字段：valid、各类写使能、pdest、
  //   loadDependency（被哪条 load 推测唤醒）、is0Lat、rcDest（寄存器缓存号）以及为扇出复制的 *Copy 副本。
  // ===========================================================================
  always_ff @(posedge clock) begin
    intWakeupDly_valid              <= intWakeup_valid;
    intWakeupDly_rfWen              <= intWakeup_rfWen;
    intWakeupDly_pdest              <= intWakeup_pdest;
    intWakeupDly_loadDependency     <= intWakeup_loadDependency;
    intWakeupDly_is0Lat             <= intWakeup_is0Lat;
    intWakeupDly_rcDest             <= intWakeup_rcDest;
    intWakeupDly_pdestCopy          <= intWakeup_pdestCopy;
    intWakeupDly_rfWenCopy          <= intWakeup_rfWenCopy;
    intWakeupDly_loadDependencyCopy <= intWakeup_loadDependencyCopy;

    fpWakeupDly_fpWen               <= fpWakeup_fpWen;
    fpWakeupDly_pdest               <= fpWakeup_pdest;
    fpWakeupDly_is0Lat              <= fpWakeup_is0Lat;

    memWakeupDly_valid              <= memWakeup_valid;
    memWakeupDly_rfWen              <= memWakeup_rfWen;
    memWakeupDly_fpWen              <= memWakeup_fpWen;
    memWakeupDly_vecWen             <= memWakeup_vecWen;
    memWakeupDly_v0Wen              <= memWakeup_v0Wen;
    memWakeupDly_vlWen              <= memWakeup_vlWen;
    memWakeupDly_pdest              <= memWakeup_pdest;
    memWakeupDly_loadDependency     <= memWakeup_loadDependency;
    memWakeupDly_is0Lat             <= memWakeup_is0Lat;
    memWakeupDly_rcDest             <= memWakeup_rcDest;
    memWakeupDly_pdestCopy          <= memWakeup_pdestCopy;
    memWakeupDly_rfWenCopy          <= memWakeup_rfWenCopy;
    memWakeupDly_fpWenCopy          <= memWakeup_fpWenCopy;
    memWakeupDly_loadDependencyCopy <= memWakeup_loadDependencyCopy;
  end

  // ===========================================================================
  // §6 访存写回的字段推导
  //   * 进旁路网络的 load 写回（mem 2 号口 = 第一条 load 流水）：只有 load 单元自己的写回才写整数寄存器
  //     （intWen = rfWen && isFromLoadUnit）；
  //   * 向量 load 写回进 WbDataPath 时，由 fuOpType 译出寻址类型（VlduType：[8:7] 区分 load/store，
  //     [6:5] 寻址模式，[4:0] 细分 whole / mask）。
  // ===========================================================================
  assign ldaWb0_intWen = io_mem_writebackLda_0_bits_uop_rfWen & io_mem_writebackLda_0_bits_isFromLoadUnit;

  for (genvar v = 0; v < 2; v++) begin : g_vlduWb
    logic [8:0] op;
    logic       is_vec_ls;           // [8] ^ [7]：向量访存（load 01 / store 10）
    assign op                  = vlduWb_fuOpType[v];
    assign is_vec_ls           = op[8] ^ op[7];
    assign vlduWb_isIndexed[v] = op[5] & is_vec_ls;
    assign vlduWb_isMasked[v]  = op[6:5] == 2'b00 & op[4:0] == 5'b01011 & is_vec_ls;
    assign vlduWb_isStrided[v] = op[6:5] == 2'b10 & is_vec_ls;
    assign vlduWb_isWhole[v]   = op[6:5] == 2'b00 & op[4:0] == 5'b01000 & is_vec_ls;
    assign vlduWb_isVecLoad[v] = op[8:7] == 2'b01;
    assign vlduWb_isVlm[v]     = vlduWb_isMasked[v] & vlduWb_isVecLoad[v];
  end

  // ===========================================================================
  // §7 发射流水（Backend.scala 里的 NewPipelineConnect）
  //   旁路网络的每个出口（src）经一级流水寄存器（pipe）进执行块 / 送 MemBlock（dst）。本层负责两件事：
  //   * rightOutFire = dst.ready && pipe.out.valid（右侧握手成功，pipe 才放掉当前项）；
  //   * isFlush（pipe 当前要不要丢）：src 这拍正往 pipe 里送（src fire）时看 src 的 uop，否则看 pipe 里那条 uop：
  //       needFlush(robIdx) = 冲刷有效 &&（"冲刷自身"且正是那条 || robIdx 比冲刷点更年轻）；
  //       src 那一路另加 load 取消（它推测依赖的 load 在 s2 被取消：ld2Cancel && loadDependency[1]）；
  //       pipe 那一路对两个 Vldu 口另加发射超时。
  //   序号：0..7 int（bypass toExus_int_i_j → intExuBlock in_i_j）、8..12 fp、13..17 vf、
  //         18..26 mem（18/19 sta、20..22 lda、23/24 vldu、25/26 std）。
  // ===========================================================================
  localparam int NUM_PIPE   = 27;
  localparam int PIPE_VLDU0 = 23;

  logic [8:0] flush_robIdx;
  assign flush_robIdx = {ctrlBlock_toExuBlock_flush_bits_robIdx_flag, ctrlBlock_toExuBlock_flush_bits_robIdx_value};

  // RobPtr.needFlush(redirect)：robIdx = {flag, value}，isAfter(a, b) = (a.flag ^ b.flag) ^ (a.value > b.value)
  function automatic logic need_flush(input logic [8:0] rob);
    return ctrlBlock_toExuBlock_flush_valid
         & (ctrlBlock_toExuBlock_flush_bits_level & rob == flush_robIdx
            | rob[8] ^ flush_robIdx[8] ^ rob[7:0] > flush_robIdx[7:0]);
  endfunction

  // LoadShouldCancel：依赖的三条 load 流水里任一条在 s2 被取消
  function automatic logic load_cancel(input logic [2:0][1:0] dep);
    return io_mem_ldCancel_0_ld2Cancel & dep[0][1]
         | io_mem_ldCancel_1_ld2Cancel & dep[1][1]
         | io_mem_ldCancel_2_ld2Cancel & dep[2][1];
  endfunction

  logic [1:0] vldu_timeout;          // 两个 Vldu 口的发射超时（下面计数器）

  for (genvar p = 0; p < NUM_PIPE; p++) begin : g_pipe
    logic src_fire, timeout;
    assign src_fire             = pipe_inReady[p] & pipe_srcValid[p];
    assign pipe_rightOutFire[p] = pipe_outReady[p] & pipe_outValid[p];
    if (p == PIPE_VLDU0 || p == PIPE_VLDU0 + 1) begin : g_vldu
      assign timeout = vldu_timeout[p - PIPE_VLDU0];
    end else begin : g_other
      assign timeout = 1'b0;
    end
    assign pipe_isFlush[p] = src_fire ? need_flush(pipe_srcRobIdx[p]) | load_cancel(pipe_srcLdDep[p])
                                      : need_flush(pipe_outRobIdx[p]) | timeout;
  end

  // ---- 向量 load（Vldu）口：发射超时 / 更老的 uop 到来 / 发给 mem 调度器的回应 ----
  //   pipe 里那条向量 load 一直发不出去（out.valid && !out.fire）时计数，src 送进新 uop 就清零；数到 13 那拍
  //   （Counter(0 until 14) 的 wrap）仍没送进新 uop 即超时：pipe 当前项被冲掉，并告诉 mem 调度器"这条被挡回"。
  //   "更老的 uop 到来"：src 送来的 uop 在 LQ 或 SQ 序上比 pipe 里卡着的那条更老（isBefore），同样回告调度器。
  //   发射成功（out fire 且是向量 load）回告 issueResp。
  logic [3:0] vldu_timeoutCnt [2];   // 每口一个计数器（各自一个 always_ff）
  for (genvar v = 0; v < 2; v++) begin : g_vldu
    localparam int P = PIPE_VLDU0 + v;
    logic src_fire, out_fire, out_stall, cnt_wrap;
    assign src_fire  = pipe_inReady[P] & pipe_srcValid[P];
    assign out_fire  = pipe_rightOutFire[P];
    assign out_stall = pipe_outValid[P] & ~out_fire;
    assign cnt_wrap  = vldu_timeoutCnt[v] == 4'd13;

    always_ff @(posedge clock or posedge reset) begin
      if (reset)
        vldu_timeoutCnt[v] <= 4'h0;
      else if (src_fire)
        vldu_timeoutCnt[v] <= 4'h0;
      else if (out_stall)
        vldu_timeoutCnt[v] <= cnt_wrap ? 4'h0 : vldu_timeoutCnt[v] + 4'h1;
    end
    assign vldu_timeout[v] = ~src_fire & out_stall & cnt_wrap;

    // CircularQueuePtr isBefore(a, b) = (a.flag ^ b.flag) ^ (a.value < b.value)
    logic lq_older, sq_older;
    assign lq_older = vldu_srcLqIdx[v][7] ^ vldu_outLqIdx[v][7] ^ vldu_srcLqIdx[v][6:0] < vldu_outLqIdx[v][6:0];
    assign sq_older = vldu_srcSqIdx[v][6] ^ vldu_outSqIdx[v][6] ^ vldu_srcSqIdx[v][5:0] < vldu_outSqIdx[v][5:0];
    assign vldu_isOlder[v]             = pipe_srcValid[P] & out_stall & (lq_older | sq_older);
    assign vldu_finalIssueRespValid[v] = vldu_timeout[v] | vldu_isOlder[v];
    assign vldu_issueRespValid[v]      = out_fire & vldu_outFuOpTypeHi[v] == 2'b01;
  end

  // ---- ROB 头的访存指令这拍被发给了 MemBlock（CtrlBlock 用来做 TopDown / 卡死检测）----
  logic [8:0] robDeqPtr;
  logic [8:0] mem_headIssue;
  assign robDeqPtr = {ctrlBlock_robio_robDeqPtr_flag, ctrlBlock_robio_robDeqPtr_value};
  for (genvar m = 0; m < 9; m++) begin : g_robHead
    assign mem_headIssue[m] = pipe_rightOutFire[18 + m] & pipe_outRobIdx[18 + m] == robDeqPtr;
  end
  assign robHeadLsIssue = |mem_headIssue;

  // ===========================================================================
  // §8 送 MemBlock 的 uop 里要算的字段
  //   uop.pc = 取指块起始 pc + (ftqOffset << 1)（指令按 2 字节对齐编号）；向量 load 的 uop 不带 pc，只剩偏移项。
  // ===========================================================================
  assign io_mem_issueLda_0_bits_uop_pc  = lda_outPc[0] + {45'h0, lda_outFtqOffset[0], 1'b0};
  assign io_mem_issueLda_1_bits_uop_pc  = lda_outPc[1] + {45'h0, lda_outFtqOffset[1], 1'b0};
  assign io_mem_issueLda_2_bits_uop_pc  = lda_outPc[2] + {45'h0, lda_outFtqOffset[2], 1'b0};
  assign io_mem_issueVldu_0_bits_uop_pc = {45'h0, vldu_outFtqOffset[0], 1'b0};
  assign io_mem_issueVldu_1_bits_uop_pc = {45'h0, vldu_outFtqOffset[1], 1'b0};

endmodule

